id=netstats-fix-lite
name=Network Stats Fix (Proxy Only - Lite)
version=v11-lite
versionCode=11
author=Hirbod-JORFlint
description=Lightweight native binder proxy fix for broken traffic indicator. No BPF restoration. Safe for devices where BPF causes 'no internet'. Reads /proc/net/dev directly via binder interception. Fixed enter_looper for reliable ServiceManager registration.
